    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca89b631795a006fe46d8b",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/122f9152c5a34449ce7c38f81823dcbc?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/122f9152c5a34449ce7c38f81823dcbc?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/122f9152c5a34449ce7c38f81823dcbc?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/122f9152c5a34449ce7c38f81823dcbc?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "scossu",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca89b631795a006fe46d8b",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This seems to be a solid case of predicate filtering in the indexer. I would evaluate the option to broaden the scope to a configurable list of properties that are to be omitted from all indexed resources. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This way, if one really wants ldp:contains triples or someone else has a problem with another predicate, they can accommodate these needs without changing the code. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
